      <p begin="02:36.260" end="02:39.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Every hour, every minute, every second (oh, oh, oh)</p>
      <p begin="02:39.530" end="02:41.340" ttm:agent="v1">You know night after night</p>
      <p begin="02:41.340" end="02:43.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'll be fuckin' you right, seven days a week (yeah)</p>
